      "lines": [
        "$|x\\vec{a}|=|x|\\cdot|\\vec{a}|$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "向量和数的乘法具有以下的性质: "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**1.** $x(y\\vec{a})=(xy)\\vec{a}$(结合律); "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**2.** $x\\vec{a}+y\\vec{a}=(x+y)\\vec{a}$(第一分配律); "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**3.** $x\\vec{a}+x\\vec{b}=x(\\vec{a}+\\vec{b})$(第二分配律). "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "这些性质的证明可以从平面几何中得到. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个向量共线的条件可以利用向量的等式表示. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**定理10(共线性的判定). 非零向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共线的充分必",
        "要条件是存在这样的数$x$, 满足于等式$\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$.**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "证明. 1) **充分性.** 假设某个$x$满足等式: $\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$. 这时",
        "根据向量与数的乘积的定义, 向量$\\vec{b}$和$\\vec{a}$共线. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2) **必要性.** 假设向量$\\vec{a}$和$\\vec{b}$共线, 并且$\\vec{b}\\ne0$. 我们来",
        "求出这样的数$x$, 满足于等式$\\vec{b}=x\\vec{a}$(1). 为此, 研究比$|\\vec{b}|↵:|\\vec{a}|=k$. 由此得$|\\vec{b}|=k|\\vec{a}|$. 如果$\\vec{b}\\uparrow\\uparrow\\vec{a}$, 那么当$x=k$时满足",
        "(1). 如果$\\vec{b}\\uparrow\\downarrow\\vec{a}$, 则取$x=-k$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$\\vec{b}=\\vec{0}$, 那么$x=0$. $\\blacksquare$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "192",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "192. 已知非零向量$\\overrightarrow{OA}$, 由点$O$出发作下列向量: 1) ",
        "$\\frac{1}{2}\\overrightarrow{OA}$; 2) $-2\\overrightarrow{OA}$; 3) $-\\frac{2}{3}\\overrightarrow{OA}$; 4) $\\sqrt{2}\\overrightarrow{OA}$; 5) $-\\sqrt{3}\\overrightarrow{OA}$. "
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "193",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "193°. 当$k$是怎样的值时, 向量$k\\vec{a}$($\\vec{a}\\ne\\vec{0}$)的长: 1) 等",
        "于向量$\\vec{a}$的长; 2) 大于$|\\vec{a}|$; 3) 小于$|\\vec{a}|$?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "194",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "194°. $O$是平行四边形$ABCD$的对角线交点, 如果 1) ",
        "$\\overrightarrow{AB}=x\\overrightarrow{CD}$; 2) $\\overrightarrow{AC}=x\\overrightarrow{AO}$; 3) $\\overrightarrow{OB}=x\\overrightarrow{BD}$; 4) $\\overrightarrow{OC}=x\\overrightarrow{CD}$, 求$x$. "
      ]
    },
